  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description\">\n  <p class=\"product-summary\">Our Mott is a sleek, minimalist silhouette—with a distinctly New York attitude. A slouchy messenger bag with a secure zip closure, the utilitarian style is crafted of glovetanned leather specially treated with a rub-off technique to reveal the base color for a love-worn look. Featuring room for daily essentials and an inside snap pocket for easy organization, the midsize 38 is finished with an adjustable strap to wear on the shoulder or crossbody. Each bag is unique with no two exactly alike and will continue to develop more character over time.</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"product-highlights\">\n    <h4>Product Specifications</h4>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>Material:</strong> Mott Messenger Bag 38 In Loved Leather</li>\n      <li><strong>Lining:</strong> Fabric / Polyester</li>\n      <li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip-top closure</li>\n      <li><strong>Organization:</strong> Inside snap pocket</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n  <details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e5e5; border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px;\">\n    <summary style=\"font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\">📏 Size & Measurement Guide</summary>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n      <tbody>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Dimensions (L x H x W)</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">15.0&quot; (L) x 12.0&quot; (H) x 3.5&quot; (W)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0;\">\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Handle Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">N/A</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px; font-weight: 600;\">Shoulder / Crossbody Strap Drop</td>\n          <td style=\"padding: 6px;\">Adjustable strap with 18&quot; drop</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </details>\n</div>",
